window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-4d6d82f6b70812af"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"run-a-student-club-project\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">运营学生社团项目</h1> <p>在一个工作区中协调计划、负责人、预算和后续事项。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT，根据项目简介、共享文件夹、会议记录、预算、成员可用时间、校园要求和截止日期，创建里程碑计划、负责人跟踪表、沟通草稿和风险日志。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>正在规划活动、出行、宣传活动或团队项目的学生社团。</li> <li>文件、决定、负责人和截止日期分散各处的项目。</li> <li>希望生成草稿和跟踪表、但不希望系统自动分派任务或发送信息的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>收集项目简介、笔记、校园要求和共享材料。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>跟踪里程碑、负责人、预算、决定和风险。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>创建学生项目工作区</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请使用此共享文件夹、会议记录、预算、成员可用时间、校园要求和截止日期，为我们的 [club, event, trip, or team project] 创建一个运营工作区。\n\n请包括：\n- 整理后的文件夹结构\n- 里程碑计划\n- 负责人跟踪表\n- 预算表\n- 下次会议议程\n- 沟通草稿\n- 决策和风险日志\n\n请标出尚未解决的决定；在团队批准之前，不要指派负责人、修改文件或发送任何内容。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"establish-the-project-hub\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">建立项目工作区</h2> <p>收集项目简介、当前文件夹、会议记录、预算、成员可用时间、校园要求和截止日期。确认日期、审批和支出规则分别以什么资料为准。</p> <p>在重新整理文件或分派工作之前，请 ChatGPT 先盘点当前状况。</p> <p><a id=\"plan-the-work\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">规划工作</h2> <p>运营工作区应关联以下内容：</p> <ul> <li>里程碑和截止日期</li> <li>拟议负责人和依赖关系</li> <li>预算类别和审批事项</li> <li>已作出的决定和未解决的问题</li> <li>风险和应对措施</li> <li>会议议程和后续事项</li> <li>沟通草稿</li> </ul> <p>将私人规划笔记与发给成员、合作方或参与者的信息分开。</p> <p><a id=\"review-with-the-team\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">与团队一起审核</h2> <p>在团队会议上确认负责人、日期和预算假设。ChatGPT 可以起草建议，但未经批准，不应指派人员、发送信息或承诺资金。</p> <p>每次会议后，补充会议记录，并请 ChatGPT 根据已确认的决定更新工作区。保留决策日志，让之后接手的组织者也能理解变更过程。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"run-a-student-club-project\">Run a student club project</h1> <p>Coordinate plans, owners, budgets, and follow-ups in one hub.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with a project brief, shared folder, meeting notes, budget, member availability, campus requirements, and deadlines to create a milestone plan, owner tracker, communications drafts, and risk log.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Student clubs planning events, trips, campaigns, or team projects.</li> <li>Projects whose files, decisions, owners, and deadlines are scattered.</li> <li>Teams that want drafts and trackers without automatic assignment or sending.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>Gather the project brief, notes, campus requirements, and shared materials.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Track milestones, owners, budget, decisions, and risks.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Create a Student Project Hub</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create an operating hub for our [club, event, trip, or team project] using this shared folder, meeting notes, budget, member availability, campus requirements, and deadlines.\n\nInclude:\n- an organized folder structure\n- milestone plan\n- owner tracker\n- budget sheet\n- next-meeting agenda\n- communications drafts\n- decision and risk log\n\nFlag unresolved decisions and wait for team approval before assigning owners, changing files, or sending anything.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"establish-the-project-hub\">Establish the project hub</h2> <p>Gather the project brief, current folder, meeting notes, budget, member availability, campus requirements, and deadlines. Identify the source of truth for dates, approvals, and spending rules.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT to inventory the current state before reorganizing files or assigning work.</p> <h2 id=\"plan-the-work\">Plan the work</h2> <p>The operating hub should connect:</p> <ul> <li>milestones and deadlines</li> <li>proposed owners and dependencies</li> <li>budget categories and approvals</li> <li>decisions and unresolved questions</li> <li>risks and contingency actions</li> <li>meeting agendas and follow-ups</li> <li>communications drafts</li> </ul> <p>Keep private planning notes separate from messages intended for members, partners, or attendees.</p> <h2 id=\"review-with-the-team\">Review with the team</h2> <p>Confirm owners, dates, and budget assumptions in a team meeting. ChatGPT can draft recommendations, but it should not assign people, send messages, or commit funds without approval.</p> <p>After each meeting, add the notes and ask ChatGPT to update the hub with confirmed decisions. Preserve a decision log so changes remain understandable to future organizers.</p>"};
